WEBVTT

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:33.640
At 19, I won a research competition
for my research on coral reefs,

00:06:33.664 --> 00:06:35.179
and I ended up speaking

00:06:35.203 --> 00:06:37.454
at the UN Convention
of Biological Diversity,

00:06:37.478 --> 00:06:38.974
presenting this research.

00:06:38.998 --> 00:06:40.686
(Applause)

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:41.868
Thank you.

00:06:41.892 --> 00:06:46.790
(Applause)

00:06:46.814 --> 00:06:50.809
And at 22, I'm getting ready
to graduate college,

00:06:50.833 --> 00:06:55.368
and I am a co-founder of a biotech
company called AutismSees.

00:06:56.275 --> 00:06:57.283
(Applause)

00:06:57.307 --> 00:06:58.562
Thank you.

00:06:58.586 --> 00:07:01.263
(Applause)